</section>
<section id="S4.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">4.3 </span>Training Results</h3>

<div id="S4.SS3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="S4.SS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">This section demonstrates the effectiveness of ReCode’s hierarchical data structure for agent training. We present comprehensive results across three environments and analyze the relationship between data and performance.</p>
</div>
<figure id="S4.T4" class="ltx_table">
