</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A1.SS3.SSS1" class="ltx_subsubsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsubsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsubsection">A.3.1 </span>WebShop Examples</h4>

<div id="A1.SS3.SSS1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS3.SSS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The WebShop examples demonstrate e-commerce navigation tasks where the agent must search for products, evaluate options against specified requirements, and complete purchases. Note that since clickable buttons in the environment are represented with square brackets (e.g., <span id="A1.SS3.SSS1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">[Search]</span>, <span id="A1.SS3.SSS1.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">[Buy Now]</span>), we use <span id="A1.SS3.SSS1.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">INPUT:</span> and <span id="A1.SS3.SSS1.p1.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">OUTPUT:</span> instead of <span id="A1.SS3.SSS1.p1.1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">[Input]</span> and <span id="A1.SS3.SSS1.p1.1.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">[Output]</span> in these examples to avoid confusion.</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS3.SSS1.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A1.SS3.SSS1.p2.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="65.93" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 550 65.93" width="550"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,65.93) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#404040;" fill="#404040" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 2.77 L 0 63.17 C 0 64.7 1.24 65.93 2.77 65.93 L 547.23 65.93 C 548.76 65.93 550 64.7 550 63.17 L 550 2.77 C 550 1.24 548.76 0 547.23 0 L 2.77 0 C 1.24 0 0 1.24 0 2.77 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#F2F2F2;" fill="#F2F2F2" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 2.77 2.77 L 2.77 40.23 L 547.23 40.23 L 547.23 2.77 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 22.45 49.62)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:31.74em;--ltx-fo-height:0.69em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:10pt;" height="12.3" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.61)" width="439.19"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
