<section id="A1.SS4.SSS0.Px4" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Step 4: Placing the First Alarm Clock</h5>

<div id="A1.SS4.SSS0.Px4.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS4.SSS0.Px4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">After the code from the previous step successfully executes and finds "alarmclock 3", the agent continues to the next task in its high-level plan, <span id="A1.SS4.SSS0.Px4.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_lst_language_Python ltx_lst_numbers_left ltx_lstlisting ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-border-color:#E6E6E6;">put_in</span>. This function is then expanded to generate the code for navigating to the dresser and placing the object inside.</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS4.SSS0.Px4.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<div id="A1.SS4.SSS0.Px4.p2.1" class="ltx_listing ltx_lst_language_Python ltx_lstlisting ltx_listing" style="--ltx-bg-color:#F2F2F2;"><div class="ltx_listing_data"><a href="data:text/plain;base64," download="">⬇</a></div>
